Port 2222
Port 2223
ListenAddress @P2P_OVL4@
ListenAddress @P2P_OVL6@
ListenAddress @P2P_PLANE2_IP@
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PidFile /run/p2pnet-sshd.pid
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/p2pnet/authorized_keys/%u
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
PermitRootLogin no
UsePAM no
AllowUsers p2prepl p2pbulk
X11Forwarding no
AllowTcpForwarding no
AllowAgentForwarding no
AllowStreamLocalForwarding no
PermitTunnel no
PermitTTY no
Ciphers aes128-gcm@openssh.com,chacha20-poly1305@openssh.com
Compression no
ClientAliveInterval 15
ClientAliveCountMax 4
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
Match LocalPort 2222
    AllowUsers p2prepl
Match LocalPort 2223
    AllowUsers p2pbulk
    ChrootDirectory /var/lib/p2pnet/public
    ForceCommand internal-sftp
